  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-e85e6b63-7fff-8f1d-f3da-816c6169ecb6\">There are those that grew up in the city, under the relative shelter of the urban sprawl. And then there are those that cut their teeth in the dangerous world outside. You belong to the second group. You grew up as a true survivor, one who did not have the comforts of the city-dwellers but have lived off of the monster-infested lands in the wilderness. You may have picked up some technical skills, but for the most part you are in-tune with the outdoors. So, with all that said, what brought you to the city?</strong></p><hr /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Skill Proficiencies: </strong>Survival, your choice of Athletics or Animal Handling</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tool Proficiencies: </strong>Vehicles (land)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Languages: </strong>One of your choice</p><p><strong>Equipment: </strong>A set of traveler's clothes, a hunting trap, a dagger, and a cryptostick with 1000 cp.</p><p><strong>Feature: </strong>@UUID[Compendium.cyberpunk-5e.cyberpunk-backgrounds.Item.kcgElThRLLj554HA]{Wanderer}</p>",
